# Design lab — MoveMatch product surfaces

## Homepage / locker-hero
Keep the locked locker language: warm dark slate, Oswald, restrained `#00f948`, room + tablet.

## Leaderboard, menu & later product pages
May **diverge from the locker photo** when the user asks to move on. Keep product continuity via brand (wordmark, green as accent only, Oswald), not by cloning the hero background.

Leaderboard lab (`/design-lab/locker-leaderboard`): **locked Lounge TV**
(Supporters’ lounge + wall TV). Tablet = interactive this-GW team sheet
(claim / XI / find me); wall = passive auto-cycle **previous GW ↔ season
highlights**. Raise/lower like homepage. Never squad-pick locker photo.
Never A/B other rooms (cabinet / bar / greenroom) in the shipping path.
Brand via wordmark / Oswald / `#00f948` only.

## Still banned unless explicitly requested
- Terminal / schema / wireframe / mono “dev tool” UIs
- Giant kinetic numeral portfolio pages
- Random unrelated genre packs (contour maps, tabloid, passport) sold as filler

## How to explore
Propose 2–3 **composition metaphors** (broadcast strip, spatial glass, tactile ladder, etc.), not color theme swaps of the same table.
If unsure — one question, then build.
